  "known_limitations": [
    "JSON numbers lose trailing zeros (79.0 → 79); the verbatim text of the source cell is not available on the JSON path.",
    "A no-change poll costs 17 D1 calls (registry/run bookkeeping dominate); caching dataset/indicator registration within an invocation is an optimization candidate, not a blocker.",
    "The source states no revision reason, so revisions are SOURCE_REVISION with reason NOT_STATED; history starts at the first local snapshot (upstream keeps only latest values).",
    "Revisions are visible only when the `updated` marker advances; a same-marker content change is rejected as REVISION_CONFLICT (source-contract violation) rather than absorbed.",
    "Eurostat terms remain PARTIAL / owner review required; availability of the API is not legal clearance."
